OL,3,GNEWSACondolence book given to family of
OL,4,APC killed by car
OL,5,
OL,6,FA book of condolence has been presented
OL,7,Fto the family of a police officer who
OL,8,Fdied when he was struck by a car while
OL,9,Fresponding to a road crash.
OL,11,FPC Faizaan Najeeb, 24, who worked for
OL,12,FNorthamptonshire Police, was attending
OL,13,Fa single-vehicle crash on Station Road,
OL,14,FRaunds, at 00:35 BST on 19 September
OL,15,F2025 when he was hit by a Volkswagen
OL,16,FPolo. He died in hospital a week later.
OL,18,FThe book was arranged by
OL,19,FNorthamptonshire Police and
OL,20,FNorthamptonshire Police Federation.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,367,360,200,160,0,100
